        "tag_name": "v1.0.6",
        "target_commitish": "main",
        "name": "v1.0.6 - Add configuration for light/dark ring colors and thresholds",
        "draft": false,
        "prerelease": false,
        "created_at": "2022-09-14T15:53:28Z",
        "published_at": "2022-09-14T15:59:24Z",
        "assets": [],
        "body": "#11 Adds `themeOptions` as a prop to `FocusRingScope`, allowing consumers to change the brightness threshold that determines whether a light or dark focus ring is presented. It also adds `var(--focus-light)` and `var(--focus-dark)` to complement the existing `var(--focus-primary)`, allowing consumers to control all 3 possible ring colors from their own CSS.\r\n\r\nThis release also restructures the repository into a more modern monorepo format."
      },
